<!-- SINGLE SHARED SVG SPRITE — every icon symbol and its defs lives HERE and
     is mounted exactly ONCE, in the root layout (+layout.svelte). Do NOT render
     IconSprite any other place. IconSVG.svelte emits only a tiny
     <svg><use href="#id"/></svg> that references these definitions.
     (Note: keep raw tag-like text such as "defs" out of comments — build
     scripts extract symbols/defs from this file with tag-based regexes.)

     Why: the library used to be part of IconSVG’s markup, so EVERY icon
     instance duplicated ~300 KB of SVG (86 symbols) into the DOM. The marker
     picker (60+ icons) inserted ~5,000 duplicate <symbol> nodes when it
     opened — the CPU spike / laggy icon menu. One sprite fixes that.

     The FIVER_ICONS_* / FIVER2_ICONS_* / FIVER3_ICONS_* sentinel blocks below
     are managed by scripts/fiver-icons.mjs — keep them intact. -->
